Dexops contains code derived from t2-BOTS / t2-bots-teleop.
Original project: https://github.com/roniejosephv-star/t2-bots-teleop
Original package authors: Mindflow / t2-BOTS Team.
The original Apache License, Version 2.0, is retained in LICENSE.

Dexops additions include the browser onboarding and follower dashboard,
local companion API, guided calibration, device identity and SQLite directory,
hosted workspace handoff, cross-platform launchers, and session recovery.

The Python package names t2_bots and t2_bots_so101, API session headers,
wire protocol, version, and local state directory are retained for compatibility.
